## Nokia domain acronym dictionary

Use this dictionary to recognise Nokia domain terms in user messages.
**If the user's message contains any term or acronym listed below,
treat it as a Nokiadomain topic.**

### Platform and product identifiers

| Acronym / Term | Meaning | Trigger context |
|----------------|---------|-----------------|
| **TAF** | Test Automation Framework | Any mention of TAF libraries, imports, or automation helpers |
| **UTE** | Unified Testing Environment | Test environment setup, UTE agents, UTE config |
| **SBTS** | Single RAN Base Transceiver Station | SBTS versions (e.g. `SBTS26R2`), SBTS OAM, SBTS admin |
| **CBTS** | Cloud Base Transceiver Station | Cloud BTS, vCU/vDU deployment |
| **vCU** | Virtualised Central Unit (5G CU in cloud) | vCU deployment, cloud CU, vRAN CU, `GnbCuOperations` |
| **vDU** | Virtualised Distributed Unit (5G DU in cloud) | vDU deployment, cloud DU, vRAN DU, `GnbDuOperations` |
| **GNB** / **gNB** | Next-Generation NodeB (5G base station) | gNB configuration, gNB operations, `GnbDuOperations` |
| **ENB** / **eNB** | Evolved NodeB (4G base station) | LTE, eNB config |
| **BTS** | Base Transceiver Station | BTS ID, MRBTS, `GenericBts` |
| **MRBTS** | Multi-Radio BTS (distName root) | `MRBTS-{id}` distName references in config/delta |
| **vRAN** | Virtualised Radio Access Network | vRAN libraries, cloud-hosted RAN |
| **RAN** | Radio Access Network | RAN test suites, RAN_PZ test groups |

